<mxCell id="lgtb" value="&lt;b&gt;Trust boundaries (TB labels on flows)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;TB1&lt;/b&gt; Player → game: raw input, world names (sanitised)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;TB2&lt;/b&gt; Game ↔ local disk / registry: saves, keybinds, the DLL file&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;TB3&lt;/b&gt; Managed C# → native C++ (P/Invoke): parser validates, layouts mirrored by hand&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;TB4&lt;/b&gt; Steam → installed files: the update decides what code runs&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;TB5&lt;/b&gt; Contributors → GitHub / CI: CI holds Unity secrets; v* tags trigger release builds&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;TB6&lt;/b&gt; LFS .blend assets → developer machines (Blender import)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;TB7&lt;/b&gt; Workshop designs → import (planned): strangers&#x27; data on the TB2 → TB3 path" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1390" y="830" width="525" height="220" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>